* <Natural Source Header
*
** RCHKPRT
** CHECK IF A PRINTER DEFINITION EXISTS
*** Author :Michel
***********************************************************************
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
1 #PRINTER-ID(A8)
1 #EXIST(L)
LOCAL
1 PRINTERS VIEW OF NRM-PRINTERS
  2 P-ID
*
END-DEFINE
FIND-NUM.
FIND NUMBER PRINTERS WITH P-ID = #PRINTER-ID
IF *NUMBER(FIND-NUM.) > 0 MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
ELSE
 MOVE FALSE TO #EXIST
END-IF
END
